===External links=== *[http://www.qualcomm.com/media/releases/2013/09/06/qualcomm-unveils-low-power-wi-fi-platform-major-home-appliances-and '''QCA''' press release on AR4002/AR4004] :AR400x series are targeted towards the 'shove the internet in everything it could possibly go into' market <small>('Internet of Things')</small> *[http://caxapa.ru/thumbs/441364/QCA4002-4004FIN.pdf AR4002/AR4004 product brief on '''caxapa.ru'''] :Interfaces noted as USB 2.0 (manuf. testing), UART, HS-UART, SPI, SDIO, I2C, 2xI2S, and its GPIOs
